{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Table provides framework-specific devtools adapters that plug into the "},{"type":"link","href":"https://tanstack.com/devtools","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Devtools"}]},{"type":"text","value":" multi-panel UI."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The table devtools let you inspect registered table instances, switch between multiple tables, and inspect features, state, options, rows, and columns in real time."}]},{"type":"callout","kind":"note","title":"Note","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"By default, the framework adapters only include the live devtools in development mode. In production builds they export no-op implementations unless you opt into the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"/production"},{"type":"text","value":" entrypoints."}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"installation","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Installation"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Install the TanStack Devtools host package and the Table adapter for your framework."}]},{"type":"component","name":"framework","attributes":{},"children":[{"type":"component","name":"framework-panel","tagName":"md-framework-panel","attributes":{},"properties":{"data-framework":"react"},"children":[{"type":"code","value":"npm install @tanstack/react-devtools @tanstack/react-table-devtools","lang":"sh"}]},{"type":"component","name":"framework-panel","tagName":"md-framework-panel","attributes":{},"properties":{"data-framework":"preact"},"children":[{"type":"code","value":"npm install @tanstack/preact-devtools @tanstack/preact-table-devtools","lang":"sh"}]},{"type":"component","name":"framework-panel","tagName":"md-framework-panel","attributes":{},"properties":{"data-framework":"octane"},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"There is not currently a dedicated Octane Table Devtools adapter."}]}]},{"type":"component","name":"framework-panel","tagName":"md-framework-panel","attributes":{},"properties":{"data-framework":"vue"},"children":[{"type":"code","value":"npm install @tanstack/vue-devtools @tanstack/vue-table-devtools","lang":"sh"}]},{"type":"component","name":"framework-panel","tagName":"md-framework-panel","attributes":{},"properties":{"data-framework":"solid"},"children":[{"type":"code","value":"npm install @tanstack/solid-devtools @tanstack/solid-table-devtools","lang":"sh"}]},{"type":"component","name":"framework-panel","tagName":"md-framework-panel","attributes":{},"properties":{"data-framework":"angular"},"children":[{"type":"code","value":"npm install @tanstack/angular-devtools @tanstack/angular-table-devtools","lang":"sh"}]}],"properties":{"data-available-frameworks":"[\"react\",\"preact\",\"octane\",\"vue\",\"solid\",\"angular\"]","data-framework-meta":"{\"codeBlocksByFramework\":{\"react\":[{\"title\":\"\",\"code\":\"npm install @tanstack/react-devtools @tanstack/react-table-devtools\",\"language\":\"sh\"}],\"preact\":[{\"title\":\"\",\"code\":\"npm install @tanstack/preact-devtools @tanstack/preact-table-devtools\",\"language\":\"sh\"}],\"octane\":[],\"vue\":[{\"title\":\"\",\"code\":\"npm install @tanstack/vue-devtools @tanstack/vue-table-devtools\",\"language\":\"sh\"}],\"solid\":[{\"title\":\"\",\"code\":\"npm install @tanstack/solid-devtools @tanstack/solid-table-devtools\",\"language\":\"sh\"}],\"angular\":[{\"title\":\"\",\"code\":\"npm install @tanstack/angular-devtools @tanstack/angular-table-devtools\",\"language\":\"sh\"}]}}"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Octane, Lit, Svelte, Alpine, and vanilla do not currently ship dedicated table devtools adapters."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"the-required-key-table-option","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The Required "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"key"},{"type":"text","value":" Table Option"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The devtools identify each table by the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"key"},{"type":"text","value":" table option. Registration requires it. If you register a table without a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"key"},{"type":"text","value":", the devtools log an error ("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Missing table key. Add a 'key' option to your table to use devtools."},{"type":"text","value":") and skip the table entirely."}]},{"type":"code","value":"const table = useTable({\n  key: 'users-table', // needed for devtools, omit if you don't want to use the devtools\n  features,\n  columns,\n  data,\n})","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"key"},{"type":"text","value":" is also the label shown in the devtools panel selector, so give each table a unique, descriptive key."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"setup-pattern","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Setup Pattern"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The recommended setup has three parts:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"start":1,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Give each table a unique "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"key"},{"type":"text","value":" option"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Mount "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TanStackDevtools"},{"type":"text","value":" at the app root with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tableDevtoolsPlugin()"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Register each table with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useTanStackTableDevtools(table)"},{"type":"text","value":" (or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"injectTanStackTableDevtools"},{"type":"text","value":" in Angular) immediately after creating it"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If you register multiple tables, the Table panel shows a selector so you can switch between them."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"setup","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Setup"}]},{"type":"component","name":"framework","attributes":{},"children":[{"type":"component","name":"framework-panel","tagName":"md-framework-panel","attributes":{},"properties":{"data-framework":"react"},"children":[{"type":"code","value":"import React from 'react'\nimport ReactDOM from 'react-dom/client'\nimport { useTable } from '@tanstack/react-table'\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/react-devtools'\nimport {\n  tableDevtoolsPlugin,\n  useTanStackTableDevtools,\n} from '@tanstack/react-table-devtools'\n\nfunction App() {\n  const table = useTable({\n    key: 'users-table', // needed for devtools\n    // ...\n  })\n\n  useTanStackTableDevtools(table)\n\n  return <AppContent table={table} />\n}\n\nReactDOM.createRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(\n  <React.StrictMode>\n    <App />\n    <TanStackDevtools plugins={[tableDevtoolsPlugin()]} />\n  </React.StrictMode>,\n)","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"See the "},{"type":"link","href":"./framework/react/examples/row-selection","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React row-selection example"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]},{"type":"component","name":"framework-panel","tagName":"md-framework-panel","attributes":{},"properties":{"data-framework":"preact"},"children":[{"type":"code","value":"import { render } from 'preact'\nimport { useTable } from '@tanstack/preact-table'\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/preact-devtools'\nimport {\n  tableDevtoolsPlugin,\n  useTanStackTableDevtools,\n} from '@tanstack/preact-table-devtools'\n\nfunction App() {\n  const table = useTable({\n    key: 'users-table', // needed for devtools\n    // ...\n  })\n\n  useTanStackTableDevtools(table)\n\n  return <AppContent table={table} />\n}\n\nrender(\n  <>\n    <App />\n    <TanStackDevtools plugins={[tableDevtoolsPlugin()]} />\n  </>,\n  document.getElementById('root')!,\n)","lang":"tsx"}]},{"type":"component","name":"framework-panel","tagName":"md-framework-panel","attributes":{},"properties":{"data-framework":"octane"},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Octane tables expose the same "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"table.state"},{"type":"text","value":", slice atoms, "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"table.store"},{"type":"text","value":", and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"table.Subscribe"},{"type":"text","value":" inspection surfaces, but there is not currently an Octane Table Devtools plugin to register."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"See the "},{"type":"link","href":"./framework/preact/examples/row-selection","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Preact row-selection example"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]},{"type":"component","name":"framework-panel","tagName":"md-framework-panel","attributes":{},"properties":{"data-framework":"vue"},"children":[{"type":"code","value":"// main.ts\nimport { createApp, defineComponent, h } from 'vue'\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/vue-devtools'\nimport { tableDevtoolsPlugin } from '@tanstack/vue-table-devtools'\nimport App from './App.vue'\n\nconst Root = defineComponent({\n  setup() {\n    return () => [\n      h(App),\n      h(TanStackDevtools, {\n        plugins: [tableDevtoolsPlugin({})],\n      }),\n    ]\n  },\n})\n\ncreateApp(Root).mount('#app')","lang":"ts"},{"type":"code","value":"<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { useTable } from '@tanstack/vue-table'\nimport { useTanStackTableDevtools } from '@tanstack/vue-table-devtools'\n\nconst table = useTable({\n  key: 'users-table', // needed for devtools\n  // ...\n})\n\nuseTanStackTableDevtools(table)\n</script>","lang":"vue"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"See the "},{"type":"link","href":"./framework/vue/examples/row-selection","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Vue row-selection example"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]},{"type":"component","name":"framework-panel","tagName":"md-framework-panel","attributes":{},"properties":{"data-framework":"solid"},"children":[{"type":"code","value":"import { render } from 'solid-js/web'\nimport { createTable } from '@tanstack/solid-table'\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/solid-devtools'\nimport {\n  tableDevtoolsPlugin,\n  useTanStackTableDevtools,\n} from '@tanstack/solid-table-devtools'\n\nfunction App() {\n  const table = createTable({\n    key: 'users-table', // needed for devtools\n    // ...\n  })\n\n  useTanStackTableDevtools(table)\n\n  return <AppContent table={table} />\n}\n\nrender(\n  () => (\n    <>\n      <App />\n      <TanStackDevtools plugins={[tableDevtoolsPlugin()]} />\n    </>\n  ),\n  document.getElementById('root')!,\n)","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"See the "},{"type":"link","href":"./framework/solid/examples/row-selection","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Solid row-selection example"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]},{"type":"component","name":"framework-panel","tagName":"md-framework-panel","attributes":{},"properties":{"data-framework":"angular"},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Provide the devtools host once in your application config, rendering the table panel from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/angular-table-devtools"},{"type":"text","value":":"}]},{"type":"code","value":"// app.config.ts\nimport { isDevMode } from '@angular/core'\nimport { provideTanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/angular-devtools/provider'\nimport type { ApplicationConfig } from '@angular/core'\n\nexport const appConfig: ApplicationConfig = {\n  providers: [\n    isDevMode()\n      ? provideTanStackDevtools(() => ({\n          plugins: [\n            {\n              name: 'TanStack Table',\n              render: () =>\n                import('@tanstack/angular-table-devtools').then((m) =>\n                  m.TableDevtoolsPanel(),\n                ),\n            },\n          ],\n        }))\n      : [],\n  ],\n}","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Then register each table with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"injectTanStackTableDevtools"},{"type":"text","value":" in an injection context (such as a component constructor):"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { Component } from '@angular/core'\nimport { injectTable } from '@tanstack/angular-table'\nimport { injectTanStackTableDevtools } from '@tanstack/angular-table-devtools'\n\n@Component({\n  // ...\n})\nexport class App {\n  constructor() {\n    injectTanStackTableDevtools(() => ({\n      table: this.table,\n    }))\n  }\n\n  readonly table = injectTable(() => ({\n    key: 'users-table', // needed for devtools\n    // ...\n  }))\n}","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"See the "},{"type":"link","href":"./framework/angular/examples/basic-inject-table","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Angular basic example"}]},{"type":"text","value":" or the "},{"type":"link","href":"./framework/angular/examples/row-selection","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Angular row-selection example"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]}],"properties":{"data-available-frameworks":"[\"react\",\"preact\",\"octane\",\"vue\",\"solid\",\"angular\"]","data-framework-meta":"{\"codeBlocksByFramework\":{\"react\":[{\"title\":\"\",\"code\":\"import React from 'react'\\nimport ReactDOM from 'react-dom/client'\\nimport { useTable } from '@tanstack/react-table'\\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/react-devtools'\\nimport {\\n  tableDevtoolsPlugin,\\n  useTanStackTableDevtools,\\n} from '@tanstack/react-table-devtools'\\n\\nfunction App() {\\n  const table = useTable({\\n    key: 'users-table', // needed for devtools\\n    // ...\\n  })\\n\\n  useTanStackTableDevtools(table)\\n\\n  return <AppContent table={table} />\\n}\\n\\nReactDOM.createRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(\\n  <React.StrictMode>\\n    <App />\\n    <TanStackDevtools plugins={[tableDevtoolsPlugin()]} />\\n  </React.StrictMode>,\\n)\",\"language\":\"tsx\"}],\"preact\":[{\"title\":\"\",\"code\":\"import { render } from 'preact'\\nimport { useTable } from '@tanstack/preact-table'\\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/preact-devtools'\\nimport {\\n  tableDevtoolsPlugin,\\n  useTanStackTableDevtools,\\n} from '@tanstack/preact-table-devtools'\\n\\nfunction App() {\\n  const table = useTable({\\n    key: 'users-table', // needed for devtools\\n    // ...\\n  })\\n\\n  useTanStackTableDevtools(table)\\n\\n  return <AppContent table={table} />\\n}\\n\\nrender(\\n  <>\\n    <App />\\n    <TanStackDevtools plugins={[tableDevtoolsPlugin()]} />\\n  </>,\\n  document.getElementById('root')!,\\n)\",\"language\":\"tsx\"}],\"octane\":[],\"vue\":[{\"title\":\"\",\"code\":\"// main.ts\\nimport { createApp, defineComponent, h } from 'vue'\\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/vue-devtools'\\nimport { tableDevtoolsPlugin } from '@tanstack/vue-table-devtools'\\nimport App from './App.vue'\\n\\nconst Root = defineComponent({\\n  setup() {\\n    return () => [\\n      h(App),\\n      h(TanStackDevtools, {\\n        plugins: [tableDevtoolsPlugin({})],\\n      }),\\n    ]\\n  },\\n})\\n\\ncreateApp(Root).mount('#app')\",\"language\":\"ts\"},{\"title\":\"\",\"code\":\"<script setup lang=\\\"ts\\\">\\nimport { useTable } from '@tanstack/vue-table'\\nimport { useTanStackTableDevtools } from '@tanstack/vue-table-devtools'\\n\\nconst table = useTable({\\n  key: 'users-table', // needed for devtools\\n  // ...\\n})\\n\\nuseTanStackTableDevtools(table)\\n</script>\",\"language\":\"vue\"}],\"solid\":[{\"title\":\"\",\"code\":\"import { render } from 'solid-js/web'\\nimport { createTable } from '@tanstack/solid-table'\\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/solid-devtools'\\nimport {\\n  tableDevtoolsPlugin,\\n  useTanStackTableDevtools,\\n} from '@tanstack/solid-table-devtools'\\n\\nfunction App() {\\n  const table = createTable({\\n    key: 'users-table', // needed for devtools\\n    // ...\\n  })\\n\\n  useTanStackTableDevtools(table)\\n\\n  return <AppContent table={table} />\\n}\\n\\nrender(\\n  () => (\\n    <>\\n      <App />\\n      <TanStackDevtools plugins={[tableDevtoolsPlugin()]} />\\n    </>\\n  ),\\n  document.getElementById('root')!,\\n)\",\"language\":\"tsx\"}],\"angular\":[{\"title\":\"\",\"code\":\"// app.config.ts\\nimport { isDevMode } from '@angular/core'\\nimport { provideTanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/angular-devtools/provider'\\nimport type { ApplicationConfig } from '@angular/core'\\n\\nexport const appConfig: ApplicationConfig = {\\n  providers: [\\n    isDevMode()\\n      ? provideTanStackDevtools(() => ({\\n          plugins: [\\n            {\\n              name: 'TanStack Table',\\n              render: () =>\\n                import('@tanstack/angular-table-devtools').then((m) =>\\n                  m.TableDevtoolsPanel(),\\n                ),\\n            },\\n          ],\\n        }))\\n      : [],\\n  ],\\n}\",\"language\":\"ts\"},{\"title\":\"\",\"code\":\"import { Component } from '@angular/core'\\nimport { injectTable } from '@tanstack/angular-table'\\nimport { injectTanStackTableDevtools } from '@tanstack/angular-table-devtools'\\n\\n@Component({\\n  // ...\\n})\\nexport class App {\\n  constructor() {\\n    injectTanStackTableDevtools(() => ({\\n      table: this.table,\\n    }))\\n  }\\n\\n  readonly table = injectTable(() => ({\\n    key: 'users-table', // needed for devtools\\n    // ...\\n  }))\\n}\",\"language\":\"ts\"}]}}"}},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"disabling-registration","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Disabling Registration"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Each registration function accepts an "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"enabled"},{"type":"text","value":" option if you want to conditionally register a table:"}]},{"type":"component","name":"framework","attributes":{},"children":[{"type":"component","name":"framework-panel","tagName":"md-framework-panel","attributes":{},"properties":{"data-framework":"react"},"children":[{"type":"code","value":"useTanStackTableDevtools(table, { enabled: false })","lang":"ts"}]},{"type":"component","name":"framework-panel","tagName":"md-framework-panel","attributes":{},"properties":{"data-framework":"preact"},"children":[{"type":"code","value":"useTanStackTableDevtools(table, { enabled: false })","lang":"ts"}]},{"type":"component","name":"framework-panel","tagName":"md-framework-panel","attributes":{},"properties":{"data-framework":"octane"},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"No adapter toggle is required because Octane does not currently ship a Table Devtools adapter."}]}]},{"type":"component","name":"framework-panel","tagName":"md-framework-panel","attributes":{},"properties":{"data-framework":"vue"},"children":[{"type":"code","value":"useTanStackTableDevtools(table, { enabled: false })","lang":"ts"}]},{"type":"component","name":"framework-panel","tagName":"md-framework-panel","attributes":{},"properties":{"data-framework":"solid"},"children":[{"type":"code","value":"useTanStackTableDevtools(table, { enabled: false })","lang":"ts"}]},{"type":"component","name":"framework-panel","tagName":"md-framework-panel","attributes":{},"properties":{"data-framework":"angular"},"children":[{"type":"code","value":"injectTanStackTableDevtools(() => ({\n  table: this.table,\n  enabled: () => false,\n}))","lang":"ts"}]}],"properties":{"data-available-frameworks":"[\"react\",\"preact\",\"octane\",\"vue\",\"solid\",\"angular\"]","data-framework-meta":"{\"codeBlocksByFramework\":{\"react\":[{\"title\":\"\",\"code\":\"useTanStackTableDevtools(table, { enabled: false })\",\"language\":\"ts\"}],\"preact\":[{\"title\":\"\",\"code\":\"useTanStackTableDevtools(table, { enabled: false })\",\"language\":\"ts\"}],\"octane\":[],\"vue\":[{\"title\":\"\",\"code\":\"useTanStackTableDevtools(table, { enabled: false })\",\"language\":\"ts\"}],\"solid\":[{\"title\":\"\",\"code\":\"useTanStackTableDevtools(table, { enabled: false })\",\"language\":\"ts\"}],\"angular\":[{\"title\":\"\",\"code\":\"injectTanStackTableDevtools(() => ({\\n  table: this.table,\\n  enabled: () => false,\\n}))\",\"language\":\"ts\"}]}}"}},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"production-builds","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Production Builds"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If you need the live devtools in production, import from the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"/production"},{"type":"text","value":" entrypoint for your framework package:"}]},{"type":"component","name":"framework","attributes":{},"children":[{"type":"component","name":"framework-panel","tagName":"md-framework-panel","attributes":{},"properties":{"data-framework":"react"},"children":[{"type":"code","value":"import {\n  tableDevtoolsPlugin,\n  useTanStackTableDevtools,\n} from '@tanstack/react-table-devtools/production'","lang":"tsx"}]},{"type":"component","name":"framework-panel","tagName":"md-framework-panel","attributes":{},"properties":{"data-framework":"preact"},"children":[{"type":"code","value":"import {\n  tableDevtoolsPlugin,\n  useTanStackTableDevtools,\n} from '@tanstack/preact-table-devtools/production'","lang":"tsx"}]},{"type":"component","name":"framework-panel","tagName":"md-framework-panel","attributes":{},"properties":{"data-framework":"octane"},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"There is no production Devtools entry point for Octane Table at this time."}]}]},{"type":"component","name":"framework-panel","tagName":"md-framework-panel","attributes":{},"properties":{"data-framework":"vue"},"children":[{"type":"code","value":"import {\n  tableDevtoolsPlugin,\n  useTanStackTableDevtools,\n} from '@tanstack/vue-table-devtools/production'","lang":"tsx"}]},{"type":"component","name":"framework-panel","tagName":"md-framework-panel","attributes":{},"properties":{"data-framework":"solid"},"children":[{"type":"code","value":"import {\n  tableDevtoolsPlugin,\n  useTanStackTableDevtools,\n} from '@tanstack/solid-table-devtools/production'","lang":"tsx"}]},{"type":"component","name":"framework-panel","tagName":"md-framework-panel","attributes":{},"properties":{"data-framework":"angular"},"children":[{"type":"code","value":"import { injectTanStackTableDevtools } from '@tanstack/angular-table-devtools/production'","lang":"ts"}]}],"properties":{"data-available-frameworks":"[\"react\",\"preact\",\"octane\",\"vue\",\"solid\",\"angular\"]","data-framework-meta":"{\"codeBlocksByFramework\":{\"react\":[{\"title\":\"\",\"code\":\"import {\\n  tableDevtoolsPlugin,\\n  useTanStackTableDevtools,\\n} from '@tanstack/react-table-devtools/production'\",\"language\":\"tsx\"}],\"preact\":[{\"title\":\"\",\"code\":\"import {\\n  tableDevtoolsPlugin,\\n  useTanStackTableDevtools,\\n} from '@tanstack/preact-table-devtools/production'\",\"language\":\"tsx\"}],\"octane\":[],\"vue\":[{\"title\":\"\",\"code\":\"import {\\n  tableDevtoolsPlugin,\\n  useTanStackTableDevtools,\\n} from '@tanstack/vue-table-devtools/production'\",\"language\":\"tsx\"}],\"solid\":[{\"title\":\"\",\"code\":\"import {\\n  tableDevtoolsPlugin,\\n  useTanStackTableDevtools,\\n} from '@tanstack/solid-table-devtools/production'\",\"language\":\"tsx\"}],\"angular\":[{\"title\":\"\",\"code\":\"import { injectTanStackTableDevtools } from '@tanstack/angular-table-devtools/production'\",\"language\":\"ts\"}]}}"}}],"headings":[{"id":"installation","text":"Installation","level":2},{"id":"the-required-key-table-option","text":"The Required key Table Option","level":2},{"id":"setup-pattern","text":"Setup Pattern","level":2},{"id":"setup","text":"Setup","level":2},{"id":"disabling-registration","text":"Disabling Registration","level":2},{"id":"production-builds","text":"Production Builds","level":2}]},"frameworks":["react","preact","octane","vue","solid","angular"],"downloadMarkdown":"\nTanStack Table provides framework-specific devtools adapters that plug into the [TanStack Devtools](https://tanstack.com/devtools) multi-panel UI.\n\nThe table devtools let you inspect registered table instances, switch between multiple tables, and inspect features, state, options, rows, and columns in real time.\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> By default, the framework adapters only include the live devtools in development mode. In production builds they export no-op implementations unless you opt into the `/production` entrypoints.\n\n## Installation\n\nInstall the TanStack Devtools host package and the Table adapter for your framework.\n\n<!-- ::start:framework -->\n\n# React\n\n```sh\nnpm install @tanstack/react-devtools @tanstack/react-table-devtools\n```\n\n# Preact\n\n```sh\nnpm install @tanstack/preact-devtools @tanstack/preact-table-devtools\n```\n\n# Octane\n\nThere is not currently a dedicated Octane Table Devtools adapter.\n\n# Vue\n\n```sh\nnpm install @tanstack/vue-devtools @tanstack/vue-table-devtools\n```\n\n# Solid\n\n```sh\nnpm install @tanstack/solid-devtools @tanstack/solid-table-devtools\n```\n\n# Angular\n\n```sh\nnpm install @tanstack/angular-devtools @tanstack/angular-table-devtools\n```\n\n<!-- ::end:framework -->\n\nOctane, Lit, Svelte, Alpine, and vanilla do not currently ship dedicated table devtools adapters.\n\n## The Required `key` Table Option\n\nThe devtools identify each table by the `key` table option. Registration requires it. If you register a table without a `key`, the devtools log an error (`Missing table key. Add a 'key' option to your table to use devtools.`) and skip the table entirely.\n\n```ts\nconst table = useTable({\n  key: 'users-table', // needed for devtools, omit if you don't want to use the devtools\n  features,\n  columns,\n  data,\n})\n```\n\nThe `key` is also the label shown in the devtools panel selector, so give each table a unique, descriptive key.\n\n## Setup Pattern\n\nThe recommended setup has three parts:\n\n1. Give each table a unique `key` option\n2. Mount `TanStackDevtools` at the app root with `tableDevtoolsPlugin()`\n3. Register each table with `useTanStackTableDevtools(table)` (or `injectTanStackTableDevtools` in Angular) immediately after creating it\n\nIf you register multiple tables, the Table panel shows a selector so you can switch between them.\n\n## Setup\n\n<!-- ::start:framework -->\n\n# React\n\n```tsx\nimport React from 'react'\nimport ReactDOM from 'react-dom/client'\nimport { useTable } from '@tanstack/react-table'\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/react-devtools'\nimport {\n  tableDevtoolsPlugin,\n  useTanStackTableDevtools,\n} from '@tanstack/react-table-devtools'\n\nfunction App() {\n  const table = useTable({\n    key: 'users-table', // needed for devtools\n    // ...\n  })\n\n  useTanStackTableDevtools(table)\n\n  return <AppContent table={table} />\n}\n\nReactDOM.createRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(\n  <React.StrictMode>\n    <App />\n    <TanStackDevtools plugins={[tableDevtoolsPlugin()]} />\n  </React.StrictMode>,\n)\n```\n\nSee the [React row-selection example](./framework/react/examples/row-selection).\n\n# Preact\n\n```tsx\nimport { render } from 'preact'\nimport { useTable } from '@tanstack/preact-table'\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/preact-devtools'\nimport {\n  tableDevtoolsPlugin,\n  useTanStackTableDevtools,\n} from '@tanstack/preact-table-devtools'\n\nfunction App() {\n  const table = useTable({\n    key: 'users-table', // needed for devtools\n    // ...\n  })\n\n  useTanStackTableDevtools(table)\n\n  return <AppContent table={table} />\n}\n\nrender(\n  <>\n    <App />\n    <TanStackDevtools plugins={[tableDevtoolsPlugin()]} />\n  </>,\n  document.getElementById('root')!,\n)\n```\n\n# Octane\n\nOctane tables expose the same `table.state`, slice atoms, `table.store`, and `table.Subscribe` inspection surfaces, but there is not currently an Octane Table Devtools plugin to register.\n\nSee the [Preact row-selection example](./framework/preact/examples/row-selection).\n\n# Vue\n\n```ts\n// main.ts\nimport { createApp, defineComponent, h } from 'vue'\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/vue-devtools'\nimport { tableDevtoolsPlugin } from '@tanstack/vue-table-devtools'\nimport App from './App.vue'\n\nconst Root = defineComponent({\n  setup() {\n    return () => [\n      h(App),\n      h(TanStackDevtools, {\n        plugins: [tableDevtoolsPlugin({})],\n      }),\n    ]\n  },\n})\n\ncreateApp(Root).mount('#app')\n```\n\n```vue\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { useTable } from '@tanstack/vue-table'\nimport { useTanStackTableDevtools } from '@tanstack/vue-table-devtools'\n\nconst table = useTable({\n  key: 'users-table', // needed for devtools\n  // ...\n})\n\nuseTanStackTableDevtools(table)\n</script>\n```\n\nSee the [Vue row-selection example](./framework/vue/examples/row-selection).\n\n# Solid\n\n```tsx\nimport { render } from 'solid-js/web'\nimport { createTable } from '@tanstack/solid-table'\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/solid-devtools'\nimport {\n  tableDevtoolsPlugin,\n  useTanStackTableDevtools,\n} from '@tanstack/solid-table-devtools'\n\nfunction App() {\n  const table = createTable({\n    key: 'users-table', // needed for devtools\n    // ...\n  })\n\n  useTanStackTableDevtools(table)\n\n  return <AppContent table={table} />\n}\n\nrender(\n  () => (\n    <>\n      <App />\n      <TanStackDevtools plugins={[tableDevtoolsPlugin()]} />\n    </>\n  ),\n  document.getElementById('root')!,\n)\n```\n\nSee the [Solid row-selection example](./framework/solid/examples/row-selection).\n\n# Angular\n\nProvide the devtools host once in your application config, rendering the table panel from `@tanstack/angular-table-devtools`:\n\n```ts\n// app.config.ts\nimport { isDevMode } from '@angular/core'\nimport { provideTanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/angular-devtools/provider'\nimport type { ApplicationConfig } from '@angular/core'\n\nexport const appConfig: ApplicationConfig = {\n  providers: [\n    isDevMode()\n      ? provideTanStackDevtools(() => ({\n          plugins: [\n            {\n              name: 'TanStack Table',\n              render: () =>\n                import('@tanstack/angular-table-devtools').then((m) =>\n                  m.TableDevtoolsPanel(),\n                ),\n            },\n          ],\n        }))\n      : [],\n  ],\n}\n```\n\nThen register each table with `injectTanStackTableDevtools` in an injection context (such as a component constructor):\n\n```ts\nimport { Component } from '@angular/core'\nimport { injectTable } from '@tanstack/angular-table'\nimport { injectTanStackTableDevtools } from '@tanstack/angular-table-devtools'\n\n@Component({\n  // ...\n})\nexport class App {\n  constructor() {\n    injectTanStackTableDevtools(() => ({\n      table: this.table,\n    }))\n  }\n\n  readonly table = injectTable(() => ({\n    key: 'users-table', // needed for devtools\n    // ...\n  }))\n}\n```\n\nSee the [Angular basic example](./framework/angular/examples/basic-inject-table) or the [Angular row-selection example](./framework/angular/examples/row-selection).\n\n<!-- ::end:framework -->\n\n## Disabling Registration\n\nEach registration function accepts an `enabled` option if you want to conditionally register a table:\n\n<!-- ::start:framework -->\n\n# React\n\n```ts\nuseTanStackTableDevtools(table, { enabled: false })\n```\n\n# Preact\n\n```ts\nuseTanStackTableDevtools(table, { enabled: false })\n```\n\n# Octane\n\nNo adapter toggle is required because Octane does not currently ship a Table Devtools adapter.\n\n# Vue\n\n```ts\nuseTanStackTableDevtools(table, { enabled: false })\n```\n\n# Solid\n\n```ts\nuseTanStackTableDevtools(table, { enabled: false })\n```\n\n# Angular\n\n```ts\ninjectTanStackTableDevtools(() => ({\n  table: this.table,\n  enabled: () => false,\n}))\n```\n\n<!-- ::end:framework -->\n\n## Production Builds\n\nIf you need the live devtools in production, import from the `/production` entrypoint for your framework package:\n\n<!-- ::start:framework -->\n\n# React\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  tableDevtoolsPlugin,\n  useTanStackTableDevtools,\n} from '@tanstack/react-table-devtools/production'\n```\n\n# Preact\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  tableDevtoolsPlugin,\n  useTanStackTableDevtools,\n} from '@tanstack/preact-table-devtools/production'\n```\n\n# Octane\n\nThere is no production Devtools entry point for Octane Table at this time.\n\n# Vue\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  tableDevtoolsPlugin,\n  useTanStackTableDevtools,\n} from '@tanstack/vue-table-devtools/production'\n```\n\n# Solid\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  tableDevtoolsPlugin,\n  useTanStackTableDevtools,\n} from '@tanstack/solid-table-devtools/production'\n```\n\n# Angular\n\n```ts\nimport { injectTanStackTableDevtools } from '@tanstack/angular-table-devtools/production'\n```\n\n<!-- ::end:framework -->\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Devtools\nid: devtools\n---\n\nTanStack Table provides framework-specific devtools adapters that plug into the [TanStack Devtools](https://tanstack.com/devtools) multi-panel UI.\n\nThe table devtools let you inspect registered table instances, switch between multiple tables, and inspect features, state, options, rows, and columns in real time.\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> By default, the framework adapters only include the live devtools in development mode. In production builds they export no-op implementations unless you opt into the `/production` entrypoints.\n\n## Installation\n\nInstall the TanStack Devtools host package and the Table adapter for your framework.\n\n<!-- ::start:framework -->\n\n# React\n\n```sh\nnpm install @tanstack/react-devtools @tanstack/react-table-devtools\n```\n\n# Preact\n\n```sh\nnpm install @tanstack/preact-devtools @tanstack/preact-table-devtools\n```\n\n# Octane\n\nThere is not currently a dedicated Octane Table Devtools adapter.\n\n# Vue\n\n```sh\nnpm install @tanstack/vue-devtools @tanstack/vue-table-devtools\n```\n\n# Solid\n\n```sh\nnpm install @tanstack/solid-devtools @tanstack/solid-table-devtools\n```\n\n# Angular\n\n```sh\nnpm install @tanstack/angular-devtools @tanstack/angular-table-devtools\n```\n\n<!-- ::end:framework -->\n\nOctane, Lit, Svelte, Alpine, and vanilla do not currently ship dedicated table devtools adapters.\n\n## The Required `key` Table Option\n\nThe devtools identify each table by the `key` table option. Registration requires it. If you register a table without a `key`, the devtools log an error (`Missing table key. Add a 'key' option to your table to use devtools.`) and skip the table entirely.\n\n```ts\nconst table = useTable({\n  key: 'users-table', // needed for devtools, omit if you don't want to use the devtools\n  features,\n  columns,\n  data,\n})\n```\n\nThe `key` is also the label shown in the devtools panel selector, so give each table a unique, descriptive key.\n\n## Setup Pattern\n\nThe recommended setup has three parts:\n\n1. Give each table a unique `key` option\n2. Mount `TanStackDevtools` at the app root with `tableDevtoolsPlugin()`\n3. Register each table with `useTanStackTableDevtools(table)` (or `injectTanStackTableDevtools` in Angular) immediately after creating it\n\nIf you register multiple tables, the Table panel shows a selector so you can switch between them.\n\n## Setup\n\n<!-- ::start:framework -->\n\n# React\n\n```tsx\nimport React from 'react'\nimport ReactDOM from 'react-dom/client'\nimport { useTable } from '@tanstack/react-table'\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/react-devtools'\nimport {\n  tableDevtoolsPlugin,\n  useTanStackTableDevtools,\n} from '@tanstack/react-table-devtools'\n\nfunction App() {\n  const table = useTable({\n    key: 'users-table', // needed for devtools\n    // ...\n  })\n\n  useTanStackTableDevtools(table)\n\n  return <AppContent table={table} />\n}\n\nReactDOM.createRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(\n  <React.StrictMode>\n    <App />\n    <TanStackDevtools plugins={[tableDevtoolsPlugin()]} />\n  </React.StrictMode>,\n)\n```\n\nSee the [React row-selection example](./framework/react/examples/row-selection).\n\n# Preact\n\n```tsx\nimport { render } from 'preact'\nimport { useTable } from '@tanstack/preact-table'\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/preact-devtools'\nimport {\n  tableDevtoolsPlugin,\n  useTanStackTableDevtools,\n} from '@tanstack/preact-table-devtools'\n\nfunction App() {\n  const table = useTable({\n    key: 'users-table', // needed for devtools\n    // ...\n  })\n\n  useTanStackTableDevtools(table)\n\n  return <AppContent table={table} />\n}\n\nrender(\n  <>\n    <App />\n    <TanStackDevtools plugins={[tableDevtoolsPlugin()]} />\n  </>,\n  document.getElementById('root')!,\n)\n```\n\n# Octane\n\nOctane tables expose the same `table.state`, slice atoms, `table.store`, and `table.Subscribe` inspection surfaces, but there is not currently an Octane Table Devtools plugin to register.\n\nSee the [Preact row-selection example](./framework/preact/examples/row-selection).\n\n# Vue\n\n```ts\n// main.ts\nimport { createApp, defineComponent, h } from 'vue'\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/vue-devtools'\nimport { tableDevtoolsPlugin } from '@tanstack/vue-table-devtools'\nimport App from './App.vue'\n\nconst Root = defineComponent({\n  setup() {\n    return () => [\n      h(App),\n      h(TanStackDevtools, {\n        plugins: [tableDevtoolsPlugin({})],\n      }),\n    ]\n  },\n})\n\ncreateApp(Root).mount('#app')\n```\n\n```vue\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { useTable } from '@tanstack/vue-table'\nimport { useTanStackTableDevtools } from '@tanstack/vue-table-devtools'\n\nconst table = useTable({\n  key: 'users-table', // needed for devtools\n  // ...\n})\n\nuseTanStackTableDevtools(table)\n</script>\n```\n\nSee the [Vue row-selection example](./framework/vue/examples/row-selection).\n\n# Solid\n\n```tsx\nimport { render } from 'solid-js/web'\nimport { createTable } from '@tanstack/solid-table'\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/solid-devtools'\nimport {\n  tableDevtoolsPlugin,\n  useTanStackTableDevtools,\n} from '@tanstack/solid-table-devtools'\n\nfunction App() {\n  const table = createTable({\n    key: 'users-table', // needed for devtools\n    // ...\n  })\n\n  useTanStackTableDevtools(table)\n\n  return <AppContent table={table} />\n}\n\nrender(\n  () => (\n    <>\n      <App />\n      <TanStackDevtools plugins={[tableDevtoolsPlugin()]} />\n    </>\n  ),\n  document.getElementById('root')!,\n)\n```\n\nSee the [Solid row-selection example](./framework/solid/examples/row-selection).\n\n# Angular\n\nProvide the devtools host once in your application config, rendering the table panel from `@tanstack/angular-table-devtools`:\n\n```ts\n// app.config.ts\nimport { isDevMode } from '@angular/core'\nimport { provideTanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/angular-devtools/provider'\nimport type { ApplicationConfig } from '@angular/core'\n\nexport const appConfig: ApplicationConfig = {\n  providers: [\n    isDevMode()\n      ? provideTanStackDevtools(() => ({\n          plugins: [\n            {\n              name: 'TanStack Table',\n              render: () =>\n                import('@tanstack/angular-table-devtools').then((m) =>\n                  m.TableDevtoolsPanel(),\n                ),\n            },\n          ],\n        }))\n      : [],\n  ],\n}\n```\n\nThen register each table with `injectTanStackTableDevtools` in an injection context (such as a component constructor):\n\n```ts\nimport { Component } from '@angular/core'\nimport { injectTable } from '@tanstack/angular-table'\nimport { injectTanStackTableDevtools } from '@tanstack/angular-table-devtools'\n\n@Component({\n  // ...\n})\nexport class App {\n  constructor() {\n    injectTanStackTableDevtools(() => ({\n      table: this.table,\n    }))\n  }\n\n  readonly table = injectTable(() => ({\n    key: 'users-table', // needed for devtools\n    // ...\n  }))\n}\n```\n\nSee the [Angular basic example](./framework/angular/examples/basic-inject-table) or the [Angular row-selection example](./framework/angular/examples/row-selection).\n\n<!-- ::end:framework -->\n\n## Disabling Registration\n\nEach registration function accepts an `enabled` option if you want to conditionally register a table:\n\n<!-- ::start:framework -->\n\n# React\n\n```ts\nuseTanStackTableDevtools(table, { enabled: false })\n```\n\n# Preact\n\n```ts\nuseTanStackTableDevtools(table, { enabled: false })\n```\n\n# Octane\n\nNo adapter toggle is required because Octane does not currently ship a Table Devtools adapter.\n\n# Vue\n\n```ts\nuseTanStackTableDevtools(table, { enabled: false })\n```\n\n# Solid\n\n```ts\nuseTanStackTableDevtools(table, { enabled: false })\n```\n\n# Angular\n\n```ts\ninjectTanStackTableDevtools(() => ({\n  table: this.table,\n  enabled: () => false,\n}))\n```\n\n<!-- ::end:framework -->\n\n## Production Builds\n\nIf you need the live devtools in production, import from the `/production` entrypoint for your framework package:\n\n<!-- ::start:framework -->\n\n# React\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  tableDevtoolsPlugin,\n  useTanStackTableDevtools,\n} from '@tanstack/react-table-devtools/production'\n```\n\n# Preact\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  tableDevtoolsPlugin,\n  useTanStackTableDevtools,\n} from '@tanstack/preact-table-devtools/production'\n```\n\n# Octane\n\nThere is no production Devtools entry point for Octane Table at this time.\n\n# Vue\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  tableDevtoolsPlugin,\n  useTanStackTableDevtools,\n} from '@tanstack/vue-table-devtools/production'\n```\n\n# Solid\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  tableDevtoolsPlugin,\n  useTanStackTableDevtools,\n} from '@tanstack/solid-table-devtools/production'\n```\n\n# Angular\n\n```ts\nimport { injectTanStackTableDevtools } from '@tanstack/angular-table-devtools/production'\n```\n\n<!-- ::end:framework -->\n"}
